## Summary

This system implements a complete **syscall tracer with timing** for educational purposes, allowing students to:

1. ✅ Understand syscall flow through processes
2. ✅ Identify performance bottlenecks (slow I/O vs fast CPU)
3. ✅ Learn kernel internals and timing measurement
4. ✅ See real-time process behavior

**Key Technical Concepts:**
- Bitmask-based selective tracing
- Kernel timer measurement (ticks)
- Per-process state tracking
- Dynamic feature enable/disable
- Process inheritance of settings

